- Extreme tiredness during waking hours despite adequate rest;
- Excessive daytime sleepiness even after sleeping more than usual;
- Feeling weak all day long without being physically active enough;
- Having trouble concentrating, remembering things, making decisions, thinking clearly, reading comprehension issues, processing information slowly;
- Muscle aches and pains especially when moving your arms or legs;
